  "system": {
    "identifier": "yoton-lava-release-scorching-stream-rock",
    "description": "<p>You coat your hand in Lava release Chakra as you punch forward creating a super-heated shockwave with enough heat to melt rock. All creatures structures and constructs in a 60 feet long, 5 feet wide line directly in front of you must make a Dexterity saving throw. Creatures standing within Molten Terrain, suffer a -2 penalty to their saving throws.</p>\n<p>Critical Success: Affected creatures take half of 6d8 fire damage and no further effects.</p>\n<p>Success: Affected creatures take half of 6d8 fire damage and suffer a -2 penalty to their AC until the end of their next turn..</p>\n<p>Failure: Affected creatures take 6d8 fire damage, are Molten until the end of your next turn and gain 1 rank of Envenomed.</p>\n<p>Critical Failure: Same as failure, but affected creatures gain 2 ranks of Envenomed.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above B-Rank, increase the cost of the jutsu by 3, and damage by 1d8.</p>",
